{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029003042272-1029_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261029005945\"/><p>日本千葉縣近海發生5.4級地震。</p><p>日本氣象廳表示，日本千葉縣東北部發生5.4級地震，首都東京震感強烈。地震於當地周四0時07分發生，震源深度約50公里。日本氣象廳表示地震不會引發海嘯。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T17:20:52.338945+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T16:30:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:38:32.760352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:18:29.851886+00:00","content_hash":"ffef61093f0b21adf0316ee3b5bdc7a79bf93892a5c02328013b7aac161cb39f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}